<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish March industrial output rises 10.8 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Irish March industrial output rises 10.8 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial production rose a seasonally adjusted 10.8 percent in March after a 9.1 percent decrease in February, Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed.</p>
<p>The CSO said the March unadjusted index for all industries was 303.0, an 18.2 percent rise over March 1996.</p>
